  "notes": [
    "Prompt SHA-256 values are computed from exact frozen prompt bytes immediately before the run and recorded in run records.",
    "T03 PDF and companion TeX are model-visible immutable inputs; calculate SHA-256 for both at staging and verify Git blob SHA-1 plus byte size.",
    "T05 PDF audit and CSV-to-SVG reproduction are distinct pipelines. Golden SVG references are evaluator-only.",
    "T01 and T02 share threshold_kinematics and count as one independent task-family cluster.",
    "Do not expose evaluators/manifest.json, evaluators/development-key.md, or golden outputs to model workspaces.",
    "Every task declares required_evaluators. evaluate.py compare rejects missing or failed required checks and verifies evaluator-result artifact hashes and payloads.",
    "For T05, E-T05B-DATA-TO-FIGURE must run in submission mode; the CI baseline-only check is not valid evidence for a scored model run.",
    "The sealed Holdout task manifest must declare required_evaluators for every task before unsealing.",
    "The pinned evaluator registry associates every deterministic evaluator ID with its permitted task IDs and a result_payload_schema. compare requires an exact registry SHA-256 match to the run protocol.",
    "Holdout evaluation uses a separate private evaluator registry passed with --evaluator-manifest; its bytes are hashed and must match the frozen protocol evaluator_manifest_sha256."
  ]
